{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And I will cut off the cities of your land</b> — those surrounded by a wall, for were it not for the fear of the enemy, it is good for a person to dwell in unwalled settlements, for the air is spacious. And the meaning: that there will be peace in the land, and there is no need for fortresses."], :book :micah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Micah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=20&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:00.193146739Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}